==Strategy==
The Pigeon de Sables and Chocolate Wall Doges are the only main threat of this stage. For their [[Wave Attack]]s, bringing a [[:Category:Cats with Wave Immunity|Wave-immune]]/[[:Category:Wave Shield Cats|Wave Shield]] unit (like [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]]) can make this stage way easier to complete faster.

==Trivia==
*Good Effort and [[Road to Hiroshi Evolution (Easy)|Hiroshi Mihara Awakens (Easy)]] and Good Effort are the only stages where [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] or [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] are not at 100% strength magnification on Level 1 difficulty.

